# Byte-exact trees: git must never convert line endings in these, whatever a
# clone's core.autocrlf says. Their md5s are recorded (release manifests,
# firmware_map.json, data manifests) and must verify after a checkout on any
# OS. The firmware source is included so a checkout builds exactly what was
# released.
firmware/releases/**                          -text
firmware/am273x_cascade/**                    -text
data_manifests/**                             -text
testing/firmware_investigation_2026-10/**/MANIFEST.txt -text
